{{Historical article}}
The '''Blood God Shrine''' was a structure that replaced the [[Golden Dante Statue]] after [[Resistance_Movement#The_Uprising|the Uprising]]. It was located in the [[Village]] at {{Coordinates|-19|68|-111}}, near the [[Librarian]] and [[Blacksmith]]. The [[Ancient Pig]] resides above it, floating with the 7 [[Shiny Relic|Shiny Relics]]. The Blood God Shrine was removed on June 5th 2021.

