When found, each Shiny Relic would appear and hover near the shrine with the in-game name of the player who found it.

== Shrine Completion Effects ==
When all 7 Shiny Relics were found, players were given the [[Pet_Items#Flying_Pig|Flying Pig]] [[Pet Items|Pet Item]], which can be given to the [[Pig Pet]].

=== Ancient Pig Effects ===
{{Main|Ancient Pig}}
In addition to the Flying Pig, the Ancient Pig introduced a set of helpful effects. Every 20 real-life minutes (1 SkyBlock day) for the next 2 real-life days after its summoning, it'd randomly pick one to apply for all [[Player|players]]. These effects include:

* '''{{Orange|Fairy Soul Infusion}}''': {{Yellow|Buff stats by 50% for}} {{Cyan|60s}} {{Yellow|every time a fairy soul is clicked!}}
* '''{{Orange|Thunder}}''': {{Yellow|A storm has begun bringing along some rare empowered creatures!}}
* '''{{Orange|Double Mob Drops}}''': {{Yellow|All drops from mobs are  doubled!}}
* '''{{Orange|Double Pet Stats}}''': {{Yellow|All stats received from pets are doubled!}}
* '''{{Orange|Increased Runic Chance}}''': {{Yellow|Increased the chance for runic monsters to spawn by}} {{Cyan|5x}}{{Yellow|!}}
*'''{{Orange|Mining Experience}}''': {{Yellow|Increased Mining experience earned by}} {{Cyan|+25%}}{{Yellow|!}}
* '''{{Orange|Foraging Experience}}''': {{Yellow|Increased Foraging experience earned by}} {{Cyan|+25%}}{{Yellow|!}}
* '''{{Orange|Farming Experience}}''': {{Yellow|Increased Farming experience earned by}} {{Cyan|+25%}}{{Yellow|!}}
* '''{{Orange|Fishing Experience}}''': {{Yellow|Increased Fishing experience earned by}} {{Cyan|+25%}}{{Yellow|!}}
* '''{{Orange|Combat Experience}}''': {{Yellow|Increased Combat experience earned by}} {{Cyan|+25%}}{{Yellow|!}}

