== Trivia ==
* When the shrine was introduced, it blocked off the Fairy Soul that was located there. It was later modified to allow access again.
* Before all 7 Shiny Relics were found, a [[Pig]] [[NPC]] that opened the [[Technoshop]] resided next to the shrine.
* Some lobbies were glitched during the event, removing the [[Ancient Pig]] and adding the [[Technoshop]] back in. The items from the [[Technoshop]] could still be purchased.

